ww.boraboraopen.com.br)","address":"Av. Embaixador Abelardo Bueno, 2510 - Barra da Tijuca, Rio de Janeiro - RJ, 22775-040","details":"Casa de Espet\u00e1culos","coordinates":{"latitude":-22.972601,"longitude":-43.388617}},"information":"**Portugu\u00eas**\r\n\r\nSer\u00e1 um prazer receb\u00ea-los e temos algumas dicas para voc\u00eas, competidores e acompanhantes:\r\n- Chegue ao local da competi\u00e7\u00e3o 30 minutos antes de modalidade que participar\u00e1;\r\n- O cubo que voc\u00ea ir\u00e1 competir deve estar em bom estado, portanto, cuide bem dele;\r\n- Se tiver alguma d\u00favida, n\u00e3o hesite em perguntar. A nossa competi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 formada por alguns competidores experientes, mas sempre teremos espa\u00e7o para novos cubistas.\r\n- Procure se divertir bastante!\r\n\r\n#### ATEN\u00c7\u00c3O  \r\n##### \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o preenchimento do seguinte formul\u00e1rio com o nome do competidor e dos acompanhantes para entrar no condom\u00ednio. Caso n\u00e3o preencha at\u00e9 o fim do per\u00edodo de inscri\u00e7\u00f5es n\u00e3o ser\u00e1 poss\u00edvel entrar no local.\r\n[link do Formul\u00e1rio](https:\/\/docs.google.com\/forms\/d\/e\/1FAIpQLSdwWJDXUOqw9hSGDnEH6aVKbNqFOBlrLukNSABQ1yUAAhk1aQ\/viewform)\r\n\r\n**English**\r\nIt will be a pleasure to receive you and we have some tips for you, competitors and companions:\r\n- Arrive at the competition site 30 minutes before the modality that will participate;\r\n- The cube you will be competing in must be in good condition, so take good care of it;\r\n- At the time of the awards, at the end of Sunday, we will draw some cubes for the competitors. Only win who is present and no one can win twice;\r\n- If you have any questions, do not hesitate to ask. Our competition is made up of some experienced competitors, but we will always have room for new cubists.\r\n- Try to have a lot of fun!\r\n\r\n#### ATTENTION\r\n##### It is mandatory to fill in the following form with the name of the competitor and c