co}{mailto:claudio9630@gmail.com}] [{Lev\u00ed S\u00e1nchez Nunura}{mailto:levi.sanu10@hotmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Seminario Teol\u00f3gico Nazareno del Per\u00fa","address":"Urbanizaci\u00f3n Patazca, Lambayeque, Bernardo Alcedo 125, Chiclayo 14009","details":"Sala de ceremonias","coordinates":{"latitude":-6.769487,"longitude":-79.84899}},"information":"**ESPA\u00d1OL**\r\nVer la pesta\u00f1a [Registro](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/ChiclayanosIndependientes2023#30276-registro-registration) para obtener informaci\u00f3n detallada.\r\n\u200b\r\nAdem\u00e1s, todos los competidores deben conocer [el reglamento de la WCA.](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/translations\/spanish-american\/)\r\n\u200b\r\nAsimismo, se les recomienda revisar estos videos para tener una noci\u00f3n mas clara de como se llevar\u00e1 a cabo el torneo.\r\n[C\u00f3mo competir en un torneo WCA - Reglas b\u00e1sicas - ASA](https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=PFCBh3i7TiY)\r\n[Tutorial para competidores nuevos - Jael Riggenbach](https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/100000565031843\/videos\/3156907307906324\/)\r\n\u200b\r\nEs importante escribir cuidadosamente los nombres, fecha de nacimiento o dem\u00e1s datos. En caso de no hacerlo de la manera correcta, ser\u00e1n rechazados. Para competidores que participan por segunda vez es necesario que hayan reclamado su WCA ID.\r\n\u200b\r\n**ENGLISH**\r\nSee the [Register tab](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/ChiclayanosIndependientes2023#30276-registro-registration) for detailed information.\r\n\u200b\r\nAlso, all competitors should be aware of [the WCA regulations.](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/)\r\n\u200b\r\nWe also recommend that you review this video to have a clearer notion of how the competition will be conducted.\r\n[WCA Competitor Tutorial](https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=dPL3eV-A0ww)\r\n\u200b\r\nIt is important to carefully write your name, birth date, and other information properly. Otherwise, your registration will not be accepted. If this is your second competition, you must have already claimed your WCA ID.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"ChiclayanoTalentIsHere2022","name":"Chiclayano Talent Is Here 2022","city":"Chiclayo","country":"PE","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","555","minx","pyram"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Kevin Antony Tello Delgado}{mailto:kevin_16_x@hotmail.com}]","organiser":"[{Lev\u00ed S\u00e1nchez Nunura}{mailto:levi.sanu10@hotmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Seminario Teol\u00f3gico Nazareno del Per\u00fa","address":"Urbanizaci\u00f3n Patazca, Lambayeque, Bernardo Alcedo 125, Chiclayo 14009","details":"Sala de ceremonias","coordinates":{"latitude":-6.769487,"longitude":-79.84899}},"information":"Los resultados de este torneo ingresar\u00e1n a la base de datos y al ranking de la WCA, y quienes participen por primera vez adquirir\u00e1n un perfil oficial. Por esa raz\u00f3n, todos los competidores deben conocer el [reglamento de la WCA](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/).\r\nEl Seminario Teol\u00f3gico Nazareno del Per\u00fa, es una instituci\u00f3n evang\u00e9lica dedicada a la preparaci\u00f3n de ministros cristianos, y nos est\u00e1 brindando gentilmente sus instalaciones para la realizaci\u00f3n del torneo, por lo tanto, se les pide un\r\ncomportamiento adecuado al Instituto Religioso. Se nos est\u00e1 permitido usar el lugar de ceremonias donde se realizar\u00e1 el torneo, transitar por los espacios abietos, y usar los ba\u00f1os. Pero est\u00e1 prohibido entrar a las aulas, oficinas y dem\u00e1s\r\ninstalaciones del local.\r\n____\r\n\r\nThe results of this competition will enter the data base and WCA ranking, and the ones participating for the first time will acquire an official profile. For that reason, every competitor must know the [WCA Regulations](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/).\r\nThe Nazarene Theological Seminary of Peru is an evangelical institution dedicated to the preparation of Christian ministers, and are giving us kindly their facilities for the realization of the tournament, therefore, it is asked to have an appropriate behavior to the Religious Institute. We are allowed to use the place of ceremonies where the tournament will take place, go through the open spaces, and use the bathrooms. But it's forbidden to enter classrooms, offices and any other\tof the facilities.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"ChiclayoOpen2012","name":"Chiclayo Open 2012","city":"Chiclayo","country":"PE","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333mbf","333oh","444","555","magic","minx","mmagic","pyram"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Nat\u00e1n Riggenbach}{mailto:nriggenbach@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Bryan Celis Zapata}{mailto:bryanc994@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[Universidad de Chiclayo](http:\/\/www.udch.edu.pe\/web\/)","address":"Ciudad Universitaria, Km 3.5, Carretera Pimentel","details":"Auditorio de la Ciudad Universitaria de la UDCH","coordinates":{"latitude":-6.76642,"longitude":-79.84083}},"information":"El costo de inscripci\u00f3n es de 3 soles (da derecho a participar en un evento), 2 soles por evento adicional.","externalWebsite":"http:\/\/www.cubingsouthamerica.com\/chiclayo2012\/index.php"},{"id":"ChienKuoCubingParty2019","name":"Chien Kuo Cubing Party 2019","city":"Taipei","country":"TW","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","444","555","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Chia-Leo Lin (\u6797\u73c8\u6a02)}{mailto:clin@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{CK Cube Club}{mailto:ckcubeclub@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[Taipei Municipal Jianguo High School](https:\/\/www2.ck.tp.edu.tw\/)","address":"No. 56, Nanhai Road, Zhongzheng District, Taipei City","details":"A