.org}] [{Sydney Weaver}{mailto:sweaver050@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Michigan Tech Memorial Union Building Ballroom","address":"Michigan Tech Memorial Union Building, Houghton, MI 49931, United States","details":"The competition is in the ballroom on the second floor.","coordinates":{"latitude":47.119008,"longitude":-88.54917}},"information":"This will be the first ever Michigan UP competition!\r\n\r\nThe Memorial Union Building (MUB) is located between the middle and west end of the Michigan Tech campus. You can get to the ballroom by following signs to the second floor.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to announce that in conjunction with this competition, Sydney Weaver and the Cubing Club at Michigan Tech will be hosting a cubing workshop, the Houghton Rubik's Rumble! Check out the [Workshop Info](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/CopperCountryCubing2019#9666-workshop-info) tab to learn about this event.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"CopperCountryCubingFall2019","name":"Copper Country Cubing Fall 2019","city":"Houghton, Michigan","country":"US","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333ft","333mbf","333oh","444","444bf","555","555bf","666","777","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Joshua Feran}{mailto:jferan@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Walker Welch}{mailto:wwelch@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Michael Conard}{mailto:mconard@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"Michigan Tech Memorial Union Building","address":"Michigan Tech Memorial Union Building, Houghton, MI 49931, United States","details":"Different rooms at different times over three floors, follow signs!","coordinates":{"latitude":47.118869,"longitude":-88.549129}},"information":"This will be the second Copper Country Cubing (Michigan Technological University) competition, in Michigan's great Upper Peninsula. \r\n\r\nThe Memorial Union Building (MUB) is located between the middle and west end of the Michigan Tech campus. Check the schedule to see if the events at that time will be in the second floor ballroom, first floor alumni lounge, or ground floor commons.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to be bringing all 18 official WCA events to the area, which doesn't get many competitions. The first CCC competition had only 8 events and 23 competitors, so this time we're making it bigger and better! Friday is reserved for big BLD and feet, so you can arrive just for Saturday and Sunday if you aren't interested in that subset of events. ","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"CopperCountryCubingSummer2021","name":"Copper Country Cubing Summer 2021","city":"Houghton, Michigan","country":"US","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333mbf","333oh","444","666"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Michael Conard}{mailto:mconard@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Walker Welch}{mailto:wwelch@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Meghan Hemmer}{mailto:meghanahemmer@gmail.com}] [{Michael Conard}{mailto:mconard@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"[MTU Memorial Union Building](https:\/\/www.mtu.edu\/memorialunion\/)","address":"Memorial Union Building, 1400 Townsend Dr, Houghton, MI 49931","details":"Second floor ballroom, follow signs","coordinates":{"latitude":47.118869,"longitude":-88.549129}},"information":"This is the fourth Copper Country Cubing competition, and we're looking forward to welcoming you to the Michigan Upper Peninsula! It's been a long time since anyone has been able to compete, so this event features two long events on Saturday evening and the more common NxN events on Sunday. We plan to host another competition this Fall with more of the non-NxN puzzles, so look out for it!\r\n\r\nAs this competition takes place on the Michigan Technology University campus, it is subject to Michigan state laws, University campus policies, and WCA policies. We will monitor all of these sou